  "description": "Paper Mouse is a crawl tunnel for younger children, shaped like an origami mouse in Pink Pearl and grey. The round front opening leads into the tunnel, and a black wavy tail behind it doubles as a balance path. The teeth-shaped form gives small hands something to hang from. Children aged 3 to 12 can crawl, balance and hang here, which builds balance, imaginative play and cooperative play. The structure is long and narrow at 17'8\" x 4'6\", so it can run along a boundary wall, with a safe play area of 22'8\" x 9'6\". One installation used a pink paw-print surface to match. It carries a 3-year warranty. Ask us for a drawing of how it fits your play area.",
